AK41213501-F100-03-05	Vitra Eames Lounge Ottoman rahi, American cherry - Nubia cream-sand	Vitran Eames Lounge Ottoman -rahi on Charles ja Ray Eamesin vuonna 1956 suunnitteleman ikonisen Lounge Chairin tyylikäs kumppani. Lounge Ottoman jakaa saman sulavalinjaisen muotokielen ja korkealaatuiset materiaalit Lounge Chairin kanssa.\nIkonisen tuolin ja rahin pehmusteena toimivat yleensä nahkaverhoillut istuintyynyt, mutta kun Eames-nojatuoli julkaistiin alun perin 1950-luvulla, oli siitä hetken aikaa saatavilla myös kangasverhoiltu versio. Vuonna 2023 Vitra toi kankaalla verhoillun nojatuolin ja rahin takaisin markkinoille, tällä kertaa ihanan eläväisellä Nubia-bukleekankaalla viimeisteltynä.	2025.00	https://www.finnishdesignshop.fi/fi-fi/tuote/eames-lounge-ottoman-rahi-american-cherry-nubia-cream-sand	https://media.fds.fi/product_image/7012443_Eames-Lounge-Chair-Ottoman_master_sourceVitra.jpg	Based on the description provided, the product in question is a Vitra Eames Lounge Ottoman, designed by Charles and Ray Eames, with specific details about its materials and style. Here are the style attributes identified from the text:\n\n1. **Iconic**\n2. **Lounge**\n3. **Ottoman**\n4. **American**\n5. **Cherry**\n6. **Nubia**\n7. **Cream**\n8. **Sand**\n9. **Stylish**\n10. **High-quality**\n11. **Leather**\n12. **Fabric**\n13. **Bouclé**\n14. **1950s**\n15. **2023**\n16. **Eames**\n17. **Vitra**\n\nThese keywords are descriptive and relevant to labeling the product by its style attributes.	To identify possible use cases for the Vitra Eames Lounge Ottoman, let's first summarize what the product is and its relevant features.\n\n### Product Summary:\nThe Vitra Eames Lounge Ottoman is a stylish and high-quality ottoman designed by Charles and Ray Eames. It complements the iconic Lounge Chair. It is known for its elegant design and fine materials, originally available with leather upholstery but now also featuring a Nubia-bouclé fabric.\n\n### Possible Use Cases:\n1. **Home Decor** - Enhancing the aesthetic appeal of living spaces.\n2. **Living Room Furniture** - Serving as a footrest or additional seating in the living room.\n3. **Office Furniture** - Adding a touch of elegance and comfort to office spaces.\n4. **Comfort and Relaxation** - Providing a comfortable spot to rest one's feet.\n5. **Luxury Furniture** - Catering to high-end, design-conscious consumers.\n6. **Interior Design** - Used by interior designers to create sophisticated and stylish environments.\n7. **Gift Item** - Ideal as a premium gift for special occasions.\n8. **Classic Furniture** - Appreciated by enthusiasts of mid-century modern design.\n\n### Use Case Labels:\n1. Home Decor\n2. Living Room Furniture\n3. Office Furniture\n4. Comfort and Relaxation\n5. Luxury Furniture\n6. Interior Design\n7. Gift Item\n8. Classic Furniture	[0.008025606,0.027427576,-0.03650705,-0.00052186707,0.016118769,0.011254764,0.004414759,0.04912644,0.02180695,-0.041425098,0.019982949,-0.022252817,-0.0025755574,-0.06625854,-0.022955395,0.08328255,0.010815653,-0.008599829,-0.048721105,0.0298866,0.029075934,0.057665467,-0.038533717,0.03780412,0.03180518,0.032426693,-0.037425805,-0.034669537,0.014537967,0.013889433,-0.0096672075,-0.026941177,0.028967844,-0.011248008,-0.013470588,-0.02360393,-0.01325441,0.00041610032,-0.009559118,0.0010665342,-0.010248185,0.0281842,0.027778866,-0.012288365,0.0050193816,-0.05182866,-0.009721252,0.029967668,-0.01721317,0.019807303,0.0071271164,-0.023509352,0.010275207,-0.043694966,-0.045721635,-0.03545318,-0.016321436,0.030021712,0.009680718,0.024846952,0.008701162,-0.026468286,-0.008289073,-0.05744929,-0.05604413,-0.016834857,-0.059611067,-0.015254056,0.02253655,-0.0070325388,0.08068842,0.034885716,-0.04591079,0.012558587,-0.011065609,-0.013497611,0.017294236,-0.019928904,0.009099741,0.025522508,-0.03191327,-0.006826494,-0.009673963,0.025576552,-0.011606053,0.0037392029,0.031994335,-0.02783291,-0.09009216,-0.044721812,-0.009065962,0.026427753,-0.016456546,-0.02494153,0.